@host = http://localhost:4004

### Cadastro (entra automaticamente no Geral)
POST {{host}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "Email": "maria@resenha.dev",
    "Password": "123456",
    "DisplayName": "Maria Alves",
    "Username": "maria"
}

### Login (Login = e-mail ou usuario)
# @name login
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "Login": "davi@resenha.dev",
    "Password": "123456"
}

###
@refreshToken = {{login.response.body.RefreshToken}}

### Renovar sessao (rotaciona o refresh token)
POST {{host}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "RefreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### Sair (revoga o refresh token)
POST {{host}}/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "RefreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}
